7:20-7:23 error bare_logical_operator: Use '.AND.' instead of 'AND' for logical operations in SSL
15:21-15:23 error invalid_operator_sequence: SSL uses '.AND.' instead of '&&'
20:15-20:17 warning assignment_in_condition: Assignment ':=' used in WHILE condition - did you mean '=' or '=='?
